BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>Vessels created from a script</h1>
oapi.create_vessel from a Lua script, at its start and between frames: from
a raw VESSELSTATUS and VESSELSTATUS2 (vessel:get_rawstatus), from a status
table, several in a row, and with a vessel class that does not exist. A
Delta-glider makes a Lua interpreter of its own (its autopilot): made on
the script's thread, the session hung at the next frame. The session must
go on, the vessels be there, and the missing class give nil.
END_HYPERDESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 51982.6685767396
  Script Tests/CreateVesselTest
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship DG
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET DG
  MODE Extern
  POS 4 0 -20
  TRACKMODE TargetRelative
  FOV 50.00
END_CAMERA

BEGIN_SHIPS
DG:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Landed Earth
  POS -80.6758 28.5978
  HEADING 330.00
  PRPLEVEL 0:1.000 1:1.000
END
END_SHIPS
